{emailSubject}Submission Evaluated - {$assignment}{/emailSubject}
<h1>Your submission of the assignment '{$assignment}' was evaluated{if $isResubmit} again{/if}</h1>

<table role="presentation" class="facts" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
    <tr>
        <td class="k">Group</td>
        <td class="v">{$group}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="k">Submitted on</td>
        <td class="v">{$date|localizedDate:'en'}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="k">Status</td>
        <td class="v">{$status}</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
        <td class="k">Points</td>
        <td class="v">{$points} of {$maxPoints}</td>
    </tr>
    {if $isResubmit}
    <tr>
        <td class="k">Re-evaluation initiated by</td>
        <td class="v">{$submittedBy}</td>
    </tr>
    {/if}
</table>

{button($link, 'See the results')|noescape}

<p class="quiet">
    These notifications are sent only when the evaluation takes a longer amount of time
    or a solution was resubmitted for evaluation.
    A resubmission can be initiated by a teacher or by an administrator
    (e.g., when the exercise configuration has changed or a bug in the system has been fixed).
</p>
